---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/layout/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer';

const lastUpdated = '1 July 2025';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer - CalculateAnything"
  description="Read the CalculateAnything disclaimer regarding the accuracy and limitations of our online tools and calculators."
  canonical="/disclaimer"
>
  <Navbar client:load />
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Home</a></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-medium">Disclaimer</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-10">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">General Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          The information and results provided by CalculateAnything ("the website") are intended for general informational
          and educational purposes only. While we strive to ensure accuracy, the results produced by our tools are
          provided <strong>"as is"</strong> without any guarantee of completeness, accuracy, or fitness for a particular purpose.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">No Professional Advice</h2>
        <p>
          The tools on this website — including but not limited to financial calculators, health calculators, legal
          reference tools, and tax estimators — do <strong>not</strong> constitute professional financial, medical,
          legal, or tax advice. Results should not be used as the sole basis for any financial, medical, or legal
          decision.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-1">
          <li>
            <strong>Finance:</strong> EMI, SIP, tax, and investment calculations are estimates based on the inputs
            you provide. Consult a qualified financial advisor before making investment or borrowing decisions.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Health:</strong> BMI and other health-related tools are general indicators only. Consult a
            qualified healthcare professional for medical guidance.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Legal &amp; Tax:</strong> Tax calculations are approximations based on generalised rules. Tax laws
            vary by jurisdiction and change frequently. Always consult a qualified tax professional.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Accuracy of Results</h2>
        <p>
          We make every reasonable effort to ensure that our tools produce correct results. However, software can
          contain bugs and edge cases. Results may differ from those produced by official government tools, certified
          accounting software, or other authoritative sources. Always verify critical results with an independent source.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Image &amp; File Tools</h2>
        <p>
          File processing tools (image compressor, PDF merger, etc.) process files locally in your browser.
          We are not responsible for any data loss or file corruption that may occur during processing. Always
          keep a backup of important files before using any file conversion or compression tool.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">External Links &amp; Third-Party Content</h2>
        <p>
          Some tools may link to or retrieve data from third-party services (for example, IP geolocation APIs).
          We are not responsible for the accuracy or availability of data from external sources, nor for the content
          of third-party websites linked from this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          CalculateAnything and its operators shall not be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or
          consequential damages arising from your use of this website or reliance on any information or results
          provided here. You use the website and its tools entirely at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you believe a tool is producing incorrect results or have any other concerns, please
          <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">contact us</a>.
          We take accuracy seriously and will investigate any reported issues promptly.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer client:load />
</BaseLayout>
